w: Who, hold- ing fast the word of truth, Seek Him with un- div- id- ed heart.
w: Thy pre- cepts Thou hast gi- ven us That we should faith- ful- ly o- bey.
w: No more shall I be brought to shame When I re- gard Thy ho- ly will.
w: For- sake me not, but be my guide, And from Thy truth I will not turn.
